l editor<br></li><li> Daily challenges</li></ul><br><strong>Nurikabe World does not have:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> City building<br></li><li> Simulation<br></li><li> Multiplayer<br></li><li> Crafting</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964540/extras/7c5d9cc054fb75bcea27b969f7ab53bc.avif?t=1738453184\" width=617 height=100 /></span><br><br><strong>Hand-crafted puzzle campaign</strong><br><br>Journey through a hand-crafted campaign with thematic sets of puzzles. The campaign is split into various difficulty levels and puzzle styles, ranging from simple tutorial maps to mind-bending puzzles. This mode offers a guided tour through Nurikabe World, teaching you valuable solving techniques on the way!<br><br><strong>Infinite generation</strong><br><br>Attain a flow state while solving an infinite stream of procedurally generated puzzles. Choose from a variety of puzzle generation algorithms and settings, either speeding through simple puzzles or embracing the chaotic difficulty spikes of unpredictable generation. Even though the hardest puzzles may feel impossible, every puzzle is guaranteed to have a unique solution!<br><br><strong>Daily challenges</strong><br><br>Not sure what to do? Solve the daily Nurikabe World puzzles. Each day there are three hand-curated puzzles with varying difficulty levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964540/extras/a3d2b8fb66c26817390ef4d5862c3bdd.avif?t=1738453184\" width=617 height=100 /></span><br><br>Nurikabe World is under active development by a few passionate individuals in Finland!<br><br><i></i>",
